  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Portraits of the Brooklyn Bridge are painted with acrylic paint on sanded 10 mil aluminum pages attached to paper hinges. The abstract assemblages are likewise made on sanded aluminum with acrylic paint, wire, aluminum tape, laminated polyster film and sand, and are attached to the aluminum pages. The type is Avant Garde and is silkscreen printed. The quarter leather binding is made of Nigerian goatskin with painted aluminum sides. The volume is housed in a felt-lined aluminum box. The series is limited to 60 books, 10 of which are held hors commerce"--Colophon.</subfield>
